      ],
      "justification": "Split into reception and re-scoring actions, preserving the original meaning and sequence."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12",
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "presentations should be attended and the proposals should be rescored based on the Q&A sessions at the presentations."
